<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Blossom (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864859262"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:19.779"><div begin="10.371" end="3:19.779"><p begin="10.371" end="15.091" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.371" end="11.091">I</span> <span begin="11.091" end="12.254">clo</span><span begin="12.254" end="12.516">se</span> <span begin="12.886" end="13.261">my</span> <span begin="13.261" end="14.457">eye</span><span begin="14.457" end="15.091">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我闭上双眼</span></p><p begin="15.091" end="18.605" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.091" end="15.481">For</span> <span begin="15.481" end="15.753">once</span> <span begin="15.753" end="16.056">I</span> <span begin="16.056" end="16.388">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="16.388" end="17.206">have</span> <span begin="17.206" end="17.446">to</span> <span begin="17.446" end="18.605">try</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这一次不必再尝试</span></p><p begin="19.179" end="22.262" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.179" end="19.487">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="19.487" end="19.801">well</span><span begin="19.801" end="20.204">-wi</span><span begin="20.204" end="20.531">shing</span> <span begin="20.531" end="21.217">for</span> <span begin="21.217" end="21.482">a</span> <span begin="21.482" end="22.262">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我幻想着一种生活</span></p><p begin="22.593" end="25.460" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.593" end="22.720">I</span> <span begin="22.720" end="22.986">pic</span><span begin="22.986" end="23.315">ture</span> <span begin="23.315" end="23.778">you</span> <span begin="23.778" end="24.903">hap</span><span begin="24.903" end="25.460">py</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你在其中快乐无比</span></p><p begin="29.461" end="33.511" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.461" end="29.793">In</span> <span begin="29.793" end="30.084">the</span> <span begin="30.084" end="31.218">weed</span><span begin="31.218" end="31.446">s</span> <span begin="31.931" end="32.261">we</span> <span begin="32.261" end="33.251">walk</span><span begin="33.251" end="33.511">ed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们漫步走在丛生百草之中</span></p><p begin="33.909" end="37.357" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.909" end="34.236">Your</span> <span begin="34.236" end="34.508">hand</span> <span begin="34.508" end="34.844">run</span><span begin="34.844" end="35.198">ning</span> <span begin="35.198" end="35.824">through</span> <span begin="35.824" end="36.055">the</span> <span begin="36.055" end="37.357">moss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你的指尖在植被间略过</span></p><p begin="38.385" end="41.152" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.385" end="38.706">I</span> <span begin="38.706" end="39.044">was</span> <span begin="39.044" end="39.353">so</span> <span begin="39.353" end="40.217">lost</span> <span begin="40.217" end="40.494">in</span> <span begin="40.494" end="41.152">thought</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我曾深陷于思绪困境中</span></p><p begin="41.396" end="44.161" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.396" end="41.573">But</span> <span begin="41.573" end="41.877">you</span> <span begin="41.877" end="42.191">were</span> <span begin="42.191" end="42.504">there</span> <span begin="42.504" end="43.628">li</span><span begin="43.628" end="44.161">ving</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但有你将我留在身边</span></p><p begin="45.721" end="48.892" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.721" end="45.879">You&apos;ve</span> <span begin="45.879" end="46.472">ta</span><span begin="46.472" end="46.839">ken</span> <span begin="46.839" end="47.071">me</span> <span begin="47.071" end="48.155">with</span> <span begin="48.155" end="48.892">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">共同居住于此地</span></p><p begin="53.994" end="58.389" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.994" end="54.361">Can</span> <span begin="54.361" end="54.834">I</span> <span begin="54.834" end="56.135">slow</span> <span begin="56.614" end="56.931">the</span> <span begin="56.931" end="58.114">day</span><span begin="58.114" end="58.389">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我可否放慢时间</span></p><p begin="58.773" end="1:02.506" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.773" end="59.174">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="59.174" end="59.435">wish</span> <span begin="59.435" end="59.736">that</span> <span begin="59.736" end="1:00.087">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:00.087" end="1:00.740">find</span> <span begin="1:00.740" end="1:01.096">the</span> <span begin="1:01.096" end="1:02.506">faith</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我希望我终能找到信仰</span></p><p begin="1:02.956" end="1:06.231" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.956" end="1:03.301">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:03.301" end="1:03.632">die</span> <span begin="1:03.632" end="1:03.979">and</span> <span begin="1:03.979" end="1:04.294">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:04.294" end="1:05.079">save</span> <span begin="1:05.079" end="1:05.407">your</span> <span begin="1:05.407" end="1:06.231">place</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我宁愿一死 为你空下一席之地</span></p><p begin="1:06.383" end="1:09.451" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.383" end="1:06.546">And</span> <span begin="1:06.546" end="1:06.831">you&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:06.831" end="1:07.174">ne</span><span begin="1:07.174" end="1:07.496">ver</span> <span begin="1:07.496" end="1:08.493">suf</span><span begin="1:08.493" end="1:09.451">fer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也不忍你再受苦受难</span></p><p begin="1:10.754" end="1:13.920" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.754" end="1:11.214">We&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:11.214" end="1:11.714">stay</span> <span begin="1:11.714" end="1:11.901">to</span><span begin="1:11.901" end="1:13.150">ge</span><span begin="1:13.150" end="1:13.920">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们定会能相伴永远</span></p><p begin="1:18.476" end="1:23.005" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.476" end="1:18.937">Oh</span> <span begin="1:18.937" end="1:19.325">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:19.325" end="1:20.544">not</span> <span begin="1:21.280" end="1:21.755">al</span><span begin="1:21.755" end="1:23.005">right</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可我仍不安心</span></p><p begin="1:23.442" end="1:26.890" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.442" end="1:23.730">That</span> <span begin="1:23.730" end="1:24.075">one</span> <span begin="1:24.075" end="1:24.397">day</span> <span begin="1:24.397" end="1:24.795">we&apos;re all</span> <span begin="1:24.795" end="1:25.427">out</span> <span begin="1:25.427" end="1:25.777">of</span> <span begin="1:25.777" end="1:26.890">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有朝一日 我们终会走到时光尽头</span></p><p begin="1:27.545" end="1:30.555" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.545" end="1:27.830">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:27.830" end="1:28.152">write</span> <span begin="1:28.152" end="1:28.506">you</span> <span begin="1:28.506" end="1:28.786">a</span><span begin="1:28.786" end="1:29.407">no</span><span begin="1:29.407" end="1:29.792">ther</span> <span begin="1:29.792" end="1:30.555">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我愿为你书写来世</span></p><p begin="1:30.707" end="1:33.486" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.707" end="1:30.837">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:30.837" end="1:31.304">sor</span><span begin="1:31.304" end="1:31.542">ry</span> <span begin="1:31.542" end="1:31.883">for</span> <span begin="1:31.883" end="1:32.967">cry</span><span begin="1:32.967" end="1:33.486">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我为我流泪深怀歉意</span></p><p begin="1:34.719" end="1:37.961" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.719" end="1:35.020">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:35.020" end="1:35.609">just</span> <span begin="1:35.609" end="1:35.780">that</span> <span begin="1:35.780" end="1:36.071">I</span> <span begin="1:36.071" end="1:37.077">love</span> <span begin="1:37.077" end="1:37.961">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只是因为 我实在太爱你了</span></p><p begin="1:44.892" end="1:51.818" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.892" end="1:45.362">I</span> <span begin="1:45.362" end="1:45.619">had</span> <span begin="1:45.619" end="1:47.739">lost</span> <span begin="1:48.013" end="1:49.335">my</span> <span begin="1:50.186" end="1:51.818">sight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的视线逐渐模糊</span></p><p begin="1:53.834" end="2:01.980" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.834" end="1:54.253">So</span> <span begin="1:54.253" end="1:54.493">you</span> <span begin="1:54.493" end="1:56.169">sang</span> <span begin="1:56.169" end="1:56.369">to</span> <span begin="1:56.369" end="1:57.220">me</span> <span begin="1:58.339" end="1:58.617">the</span> <span begin="1:58.617" end="1:59.252">beau</span><span begin="1:59.252" end="1:59.602">ty</span> <span begin="1:59.602" end="2:00.325">you&apos;d</span> <span begin="2:00.325" end="2:00.742">been</span> <span begin="2:00.742" end="2:01.372">see</span><span begin="2:01.372" end="2:01.980">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你就将沿途的美好一一化作歌声唱响</span></p><p begin="2:02.396" end="2:07.766" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.396" end="2:02.629">If</span> <span begin="2:02.629" end="2:03.016">I</span> <span begin="2:03.016" end="2:04.890">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:04.890" end="2:06.400">stop</span> <span begin="2:06.841" end="2:07.766">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">倘若我阻止不了时间</span></p><p begin="2:09.569" end="2:17.567" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.569" end="2:09.921">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="2:09.921" end="2:10.320">build</span> <span begin="2:10.320" end="2:10.604">a</span> <span begin="2:10.604" end="2:11.425">world</span> <span begin="2:12.554" end="2:13.482">where</span> <span begin="2:14.435" end="2:15.526">God</span> <span begin="2:15.526" end="2:15.842">can</span><span begin="2:15.842" end="2:16.188">not</span> <span begin="2:16.188" end="2:16.617">take</span> <span begin="2:16.617" end="2:17.567">us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会构建一个与世隔绝之地</span></p><p begin="2:17.567" end="2:24.262" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.567" end="2:18.017">There&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:18.017" end="2:18.244">no</span> <span begin="2:18.244" end="2:19.907">need</span> <span begin="2:20.246" end="2:20.571">to</span> <span begin="2:20.571" end="2:21.796">think</span> <span begin="2:22.647" end="2:22.913">of</span> <span begin="2:22.913" end="2:24.262">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那里不必忧虑时间流逝</span></p><p begin="2:26.933" end="2:30.383" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.933" end="2:27.223">But</span> <span begin="2:27.223" end="2:28.330">then</span> <span begin="2:29.171" end="2:29.347">you</span> <span begin="2:29.347" end="2:30.383">said</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但你说</span></p><p begin="2:31.274" end="2:34.872" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:31.274" end="2:31.596">&quot;Don&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:31.596" end="2:31.891">think</span> <span begin="2:31.891" end="2:32.209">of</span> <span begin="2:32.209" end="2:32.517">the</span> <span begin="2:32.517" end="2:33.194">time</span> <span begin="2:33.194" end="2:33.546">that&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:33.546" end="2:34.872">left</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所剩多久时间都不要紧</span></p><p begin="2:35.372" end="2:38.645" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.372" end="2:35.710">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:35.710" end="2:36.058">spen</span><span begin="2:36.058" end="2:36.381">ding</span> <span begin="2:36.381" end="2:36.682">it</span> <span begin="2:36.682" end="2:37.289">in</span> <span begin="2:37.289" end="2:37.755">your</span> <span begin="2:37.755" end="2:38.645">head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你已为此困扰了太久</span></p><p begin="2:38.645" end="2:41.518" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.645" end="2:38.794">I</span> <span begin="2:38.794" end="2:39.109">just</span> <span begin="2:39.109" end="2:39.360">want</span> <span begin="2:39.360" end="2:39.681">you</span> <span begin="2:39.681" end="2:40.646">laugh</span><span begin="2:40.646" end="2:41.518">ing&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我只想你开心快乐便好</span></p><p begin="2:42.551" end="2:45.728" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.551" end="2:42.703">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="2:42.703" end="2:43.212">sor</span><span begin="2:43.212" end="2:43.492">ry</span> <span begin="2:43.492" end="2:43.700">for</span> <span begin="2:43.700" end="2:45.003">cry</span><span begin="2:45.003" end="2:45.728">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我为我流泪深怀歉意</span></p><p begin="2:47.306" end="2:51.873" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.306" end="2:47.563">I</span> <span begin="2:47.563" end="2:48.019">just</span> <span begin="2:48.019" end="2:48.322">want</span> <span begin="2:48.322" end="2:48.822">you</span> <span begin="2:48.822" end="2:50.060">hap</span><span begin="2:50.060" end="2:51.873">py</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只是因为 我实在太爱你了</span></p><p begin="2:55.776" end="3:02.878" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.776" end="2:56.114">So</span> <span begin="2:56.114" end="2:56.508">at</span> <span begin="2:56.508" end="2:57.958">last</span> <span begin="2:59.126" end="3:00.586">good</span><span begin="3:01.410" end="3:02.878">bye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">最后 再见</span></p><p begin="3:04.685" end="3:08.636" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.685" end="3:05.117">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="3:05.117" end="3:05.490">be</span> <span begin="3:05.490" end="3:07.542">hap</span><span begin="3:07.542" end="3:08.636">py</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">认识你</span></p><p begin="3:09.732" end="3:12.730" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:09.732" end="3:10.993">Just</span> <span begin="3:10.993" end="3:11.257">to</span> <span begin="3:11.257" end="3:11.656">have</span> <span begin="3:11.656" end="3:12.059">known</span> <span begin="3:12.059" end="3:12.730">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是我一生至幸</span></p><p begin="3:13.144" end="3:19.779" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.144" end="3:13.444">And</span> <span begin="3:13.444" end="3:13.805">we</span> <span begin="3:13.805" end="3:14.873">wish</span><span begin="3:14.873" end="3:15.199">ed</span> <span begin="3:15.654" end="3:16.017">each</span> <span begin="3:16.017" end="3:17.204">o</span><span begin="3:18.142" end="3:18.524">ther</span> <span begin="3:18.524" end="3:19.779">well</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">愿彼此能安得始终</span></p></div></body></tt>